place RT_CommRadio fogradio at 2.8 3.6 y=2 sit drop yaw=180
place RT_PowerBox safekeypad at 4.36 1.2 y=1.3 yaw=270
place Loot_Chest controlsafe at 3.6 2.4 y=0.25 sit yaw=270
