call hw_machine x=0 z=26 yaw=180 al=fw_machine nm="Fog horn" obj=RT_PowerBox sc=1 a=fw_top b=fw_cave done=fw_fixed rew=fw_rewchest rnote=fw_rewnote msg="It works." hint="It wants the fog lamp lens from Smoke Hill and the fog-line valve key from Condensate Cave."
call hw_note x=-2.6 z=27.2 yaw=200 al=fw_hint

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=The Fogworks
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Nimbus Works' fourth station: a works town over a shallow bay, its streets plank boardwalks on posts, workers' cottages on stilts, and two hourglass cooling towers still breathing fog. The fourth island of The Rainmakers. Raft-sized: high ground, a cave, a ruined house where Hanne Vik still lives, a crashed plane and secrets off the path.
island on.arrive=message||A bay full of fog. Out of it rise two great grey towers, pinched in the middle like hourglasses - and under them a town on stilts.

story foglines|Fog lines routed|Placeable_Pipe_Water|The fog lines run through the cable hub to the control room again.
story confession|Dagny's first tape|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|Dagny Holm's first confession, played on the Fogworks radio.
story boilerkey|Boilerman's cage key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The key of the cage behind the Fogworks boiler, from the Founders' Day crate.

note bulletin Fogworks bulletin | NIMBUS WORKS - THE FOGWORKS - SHIFT BULLETIN\n\nFog lines: valves A and C OPEN, valve B SHUT. Any other way and the control room goes dark.\n\nRats in the cold condenser again. Do not go in alone.\n\nFounders' Day: the crate in the boiler house is NOT to be opened before the chief engineer's broadcast.\n\nMattis - stop sleeping in the boiler cage.
note chiefnotes Shift chief's notes | Shift chief's notes, last week:\n\nThe towers will not stop. We shut the burners and the fog keeps coming - the Rain Engine is feeding them from the mountain.\n\nThe safe holds the engine control plans. Code: 3157. If I'm not back, give them to whoever can use them.\n\nDagny is going on the radio tonight. God help her.
note controlsafe Control room safe | The control room's safe: Nimbus Works' plans for engine controls, and the shift's petty cash in scrap.
loot controlsafe Blueprint_EngineControls*1;Scrap*4;Bolt*2
prop controlsafe loot.refill=0
prop controlsafe obj.name=controlsafe
prop controlsafe beh.hidden=1
note towerchest Tower cabin chest | The tower watch's chest on top of the cooling tower: a metal detector's plans, for finding what the fog buries.
loot towerchest Blueprint_MetalDetector*1;Rope*2;Plank*4
prop towerchest loot.refill=0
note foundercrate Founders' Day crate | The Founders' Day crate: fireworks for the company's birthday, zipline plans for the parade - and a key on a string, CAGE.
loot foundercrate Blueprint_Firework*1;Blueprint_ZiplineBase*1;Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;Blueprint_BatteryCharger*1;story:boilerkey*1;Rope*2
prop foundercrate loot.refill=0
prop foundercrate if.open=signal|radio
prop foundercrate else.open=message||The Founders' Day crate: NOT TO BE OPENED BEFORE THE CHIEF ENGINEER'S BROADCAST.
note mattislocker Boilerman's locker | Mattis's locker: his tools, his good boots, a tin of metal bits he saved.
loot mattislocker MetalIngot*4;Bolt*4;Hinge*2;ExplosiveGoo*3
prop mattislocker loot.refill=0
prop mattislocker if.open=signal|mattisfree
prop mattislocker else.open=message||Mattis's locker, padlocked. The padlock key is on the man himself.

prop valveA obj.name=valveA
prop valveB obj.name=valveB
prop valveC obj.name=valveC
prop valveA on.use=switch|\nmessage||Valve A squeals a quarter turn.
prop valveB on.use=switch|\nmessage||Valve B squeals a quarter turn.
prop valveC on.use=switch|\nmessage||Valve C squeals a quarter turn.
prop fogwire obj.name=fogwire
prop fogwire beh.use=Close the fog lines' circuit
prop fogwire if.use=state|valveA|open\nstate|valveB|closed\nstate|valveC|open
prop fogwire on.use=message||The hub hums, the lamps of the control room flicker on, and somewhere behind the walls the fog lines thump into rhythm.\nsignal||wire\nsignal||power\ngive||story:foglines*1
prop fogwire else.use=message||The hub sparks and dies. The fog lines are not set as the bulletin says.
prop fogradio obj.name=fogradio
prop fogradio on.use=message||A crackle, then a woman's tired voice: "This is Dagny Holm, chief engineer. We made the rain. We could not stop it. I'm sorry." The tape runs out. Then, on the same band: the next station, Vaporhold Reservoir, on 1000.\nplaysound|fogradio|event:/raft/radio/radio_transmitter|0.6||island\nsignal||radio\ngive||story:confession*1
prop safekeypad obj.name=safekeypad
prop safekeypad beh.use=Type the code
prop safekeypad lock.code=3157
prop safekeypad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||The keypad beeps and the safe's door swings open.\nshow|controlsafe
prop boiler beh.use=
prop boiler if.use=
prop boiler else.use=
prop boiler on.use=message||The boiler is cold. Behind it, in a cage of iron bars, somebody is snoring.

prop mattiscage obj.name=mattiscage
prop mattiscage survivor.name=Mattis
prop mattiscage survivor.id=rainmakers_mattis
prop mattiscage survivor.key=boilerkey
prop mattiscage survivor.signal=mattisfree
prop mattiscage survivor.line=Is it Founders' Day already? ... Oh. Oh, it's you. I locked myself in to sleep where it's warm and dropped the key. I'm Mattis. Take me off this island.

prop towndock zone.id=town_dock
prop towndock zone.radius=4
prop towndock zone.message=The Fogworks dock: a bulletin board at the street's end, fog rolling over the boardwalks.
prop pumphall zone.id=pump_hall
prop pumphall zone.radius=3.5
prop pumphall zone.message=The pump hall: three valves on the wall outside, the fog lines' pipes vanishing into the floor.
prop condenser zone.id=condenser
prop condenser zone.radius=3.5
prop condenser zone.repeat=never
prop condenser zone.message=The cold condenser - and something squeaking in the dark. Rats!
prop rats creature.count=4
prop rats creature.respawn=0
prop rats creature.zone=condenser
prop towertop zone.id=tower_top
prop towertop zone.radius=4
prop towertop zone.message=The top of the cooling tower: the whole fog bay under you, and far off a lake shining on another island.

story fw_top|Fog lamp lens|Bolt|The fog lookout's lamp lens, unscrewed and wrapped in a rag.
story fw_cave|Fog-line valve key|Bolt|The master key of the fog-line valves, dropped in the cave.
story fw_fixed|Fog horn working|Bolt|The fog horn, working again.
note fw_hint Night shift notice | THE FOG HORN IS DEAD. It wants the lens from the fog lookout on Smoke Hill and the valve key from the Condensate Cave, the rock cave in the far hillside. Hanne at the old house outside town knows.
note fw_topchest Fog lookout deck box | A box lashed to the deck rail at the top of the fog lookout.
loot fw_topchest story:fw_top*1;Glass*2;Scrap*2
note fw_cavechest Condensate Cave chest | A chest at the back of Condensate Cave, dry under the rock.
loot fw_cavechest story:fw_cave*1;Bolt*3;Plastic*2
note fw_rewnote Fog horn tape | The horn booms over the bay and the fog lifts off the water. A tape in its box: the night shift's last call - 'We make the fog, they make the rain, and nobody in town has seen the sun in four years.'
note fw_rewchest Fog horn reward | What the fog horn kept.
loot fw_rewchest MetalIngot*2;Bolt*3;TradeToken*2
note fw_lampchest Hanne's shift box | Hanne's shift box: her thermos, her pay, and a picture of the bay without fog.
loot fw_lampchest MetalIngot*1;TradeToken*2;Rope*2
note fw_setchest Shift chest | The shift foreman's chest: every token handed back at last.
loot fw_setchest MetalIngot*2;Bolt*3;TradeToken*2
note fw_planecrate Supply plane's crate | The supply plane's crate: condenser coils, gloves, coffee.
loot fw_planecrate CopperIngot*1;Scrap*3;Plastic*2
prop fw_planecrate loot.refill=0
note fw_pilot Supply pilot's note | FOGWORKS SUPPLY RUN. Couldn't see the dock for fog. Put her down on the grass beyond the town. Coffee in the crate - the night shift deserves it.
note jcfw Stack perch | The boiler hands' perch on the old stacks.
loot jcfw Rope*3;Plank*4;MetalIngot*1
note jbfw Stack top | Something left at the top of the stacks.
loot jbfw CopperIngot*1;Bolt*2;TradeToken*1

quest title=The Fog Shift
quest intro=A works town on stilts in a fog bay. Make for the two tall cooling towers; the dock is at the foot of the town.
step reach|town_dock|1|Make for the cooling towers and tie up at the Fogworks dock
step read|Fogworks bulletin|1|Read the bulletin at the end of the street
step reach|pump_hall|1|Go to the pump hall on the yard
step collect|story:foglines|1|Set the fog-line valves as the bulletin says and close the circuit at the control room's cable hub
step read|Shift chief's notes|1|Read the shift chief's notes in the control room
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the cold condenser
step open|Control room safe|1|Open the control room safe
step blueprint|Blueprint_EngineControls|1|Take the engine controls plans from the control room safe
step reach|tower_top|1|Climb to the top of the cooling tower with the cabin on it
step open|Tower cabin chest|1|Open the chest on the tower top
step blueprint|Blueprint_MetalDetector|1|Take the metal detector plans from the tower cabin chest
step collect|story:confession|1|Play the tape on the control room's radio
step open|Founders' Day crate|1|Open the Founders' Day crate in the boiler house
step blueprint|Blueprint_Firework|1|Take the firework plans from the founders' Day crate
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineBase|1|Take the zipline plans from the founders' Day crate
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineTool|1|Take the zipline tool plans from the founders' Day crate
step blueprint|Blueprint_BatteryCharger|1|Take the battery charger plans from the founders' Day crate
step read|Night shift notice|1|Read the night shift notice by the fog horn
step talk|Hanne Vik|1|Talk to Hanne Vik at the ruined house outside town
step reach|fw_trail|1|Find the foot of the trail up Smoke Hill, below the fog lookout
step reach|fw_summit|1|Climb the trail to the top of Smoke Hill
step collect|story:fw_top|1|Climb the fog lookout and take the fog lamp lens from the box on its deck
step reach|fw_cave|1|Find Condensate Cave, the rock cave in the far hillside
step collect|story:fw_cave|1|Take the fog-line valve key from the chest at the back of the cave
step read|Fog horn tape|1|Bring both to the fog horn and read what it shows
step open|Boilerman's locker|1|Free Mattis from the cage behind the boiler, then open his locker
quest done=Mattis is coming with you, and Dagny Holm's voice is in your ears. Vaporhold Reservoir answers on 1000.
quest reward=MetalIngot*4;Plank*8;Rope*3

# Buried treasure (the story line's middle): titanium ore on top of Raft's own treasure loot - the metal detector finds it, the shovel digs it
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=45 n=1 seed=8828
prop treasure8828 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*3
# Puffer fish off the shore (explosive goo)
place Creature_PufferFish puffers at 0 100 h=-3
prop puffers creature.count=3

save The Fogworks
